    {
     "_key": "QRM8yCNleIzHnxgUycy1Lp",
     "name": "Why I'm standing",
     "value": "As a medical doctor I am concerned about the serious decline in quality and delivery of New Zealand's once-excellent health system. Additionally, we need to address diet and exercise with a mind towards prevention. When in Parliament I intend to work hard to focus government attention on our medical and health crisis."
    },
    {
     "_key": "QRM8yCNleIzHnxgUycy1OE",
     "name": "About me",
     "value": "Thirty years in New Zealand has sharpened my sense of its unique position and ability to shape world opinion. I am a fighter and will give my all to turn our country back on the right path of serving its people and not global controlling interests."
    }
