    {
     "_key": "FWxtFpcrQTiIEeORrE4n4G",
     "name": "Why I'm standing",
     "value": "I am running to restore sanity and balance to our Parliament and Government. Our Government is currently rife with insanity, and many are out of touch with the real world. I will prove to the world that we can indeed have a Government that can be relied upon and trusted by the people to protect them from foreign adversaries and the uncertainty of new technology that poses new challenges for our Nation."
    },
    {
     "_key": "FWxtFpcrQTiIEeORrE4n6a",
     "name": "About me",
     "value": "I have a wealth of academic knowledge and prowess up to the Masters level. I am not afraid to step out of the party line to voice my real views on election bills. I have the confidence to lead and I value my views and ability to help others. I am different from the rest, support me and the party I fight for and we can get this country back on track."
    }
