     "_key": "klxxTI2yzqiQIMrdxnTE8Z",
     "name": "Why I'm standing",
     "value": "I am sick of seeing money wasted on bureaucracy that is bloated and endless consultants. I want to see New Zealand move toward a direct democracy, where people get the say and governments' jobs are to carry out the will of the people. I also in the first instance will be looking for accountability on decisions made by government & using Parliamentary privilege to call out lies where I see them."
