    {
     "_key": "klxxTI2yzqiQIMrdxnTEB5",
     "name": "About me",
     "value": "I fight the good fight everyday calling out MPs for their dishonesty with the public. Via OIAs I have done a lot to reveal mistruths particularly around the covid response. I am also here supporting Sue Grey for West Coast-Tasman having lived here for 34 years."
